 equation, we have that $v=⟨3,-9,-5⟩$ and $w=⟨-8,9,3⟩$ are parallel to the plane.\n\nNow, we need to find a normal vector of the plane. To do that, we use the cross product of $v$ and $w$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & =v\\times w \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -9 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}]\\times [\\begin{aligned}-8 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 3 & -9 & -5 \\\\ -8 & 9 & 3\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =18i+31j-45k \\\\  & =⟨18,31,-45⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, a normal vector to the plane is $n=⟨18,31,-45⟩.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-33820/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "62196ae9-df2e-5a3a-bc0a-1c0f4c40af3e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-33820"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-70977/selection/088f4a55a254e55e24242b151c05cedf430b990edb5dc3a1072053b671318064" :answer/id #uuid "fd2f1286-8e8e-54e9-83e0-00ae587589db" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r=⟨4,-1,5⟩+s⟨6,2,1⟩+t⟨0,2,3⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70977/selection/354ad8c4fa0fae73d9a3643182ff185484e8042259b71db3a91c30ecd6ce4061" :answer/id #uuid "19829ab3-e516-56af-9883-d98a9cfdab64" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r=⟨0,2,3⟩+s⟨4,-1,5⟩+t⟨6,2,1⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70977/selection/196e4d724d48d3fd3b8d805e79f9e945d25a927cf558eae7557f8dd1afaea54b" :answer/id #uuid "f8986253-0a1d-5570-ad10-8b2250320ed4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r=⟨6,2,1⟩+s⟨\\frac{1}{2},1,9⟩+t⟨3,10,-1⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70977/selection/9f11052a6d8f4e81137612e2560d45cee669a186e9ff389b30e13c5f8599521c" :answer/id #uuid "90b41b64-0ae8-532a-be29-f3e35a9fb2a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r=⟨6,2,1⟩+s⟨4,-1,5⟩+t⟨0,2,3⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure 